WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:39.883
Same candidates. Better precision and better recall?

00:00:39.883 --> 00:01:18.331
Relevant to whom, for what purpose?

00:01:18.331 --> 00:01:57.745
Every metric inherits the assessors’ criteria

00:01:57.745 --> 00:02:38.479
Precision and recall divide by different things

00:02:38.479 --> 00:03:16.602
Reordering changes the display, not candidate membership

00:03:16.602 --> 00:03:57.002
A fresh route can cross the candidate boundary

00:03:57.002 --> 00:04:34.477
Where did the recall denominator come from?

00:04:34.477 --> 00:05:21.600
Choose the sensitivity and workload the task requires
